  <AltText>
    Artfight attack of Vladislava Tverdokhliba from SylvieStarr. Vladislava is a protogen dragon with very bright green horns which are glowing. The rest of its body is encased in the armour, which, despite being primarily composed solid lead, is white, gray, and darkish green in colour. The panels and visor are black with the glowing spots being blue. On the front of the torso is a trefoil symbol warning that Vladislava is, in fact, radioactive. There is a faint blue glow around atom due to radiation exciting the particles in the air.
  </AltText>
  <Description>
    A super cool character to draw! :D
  </Description>
